## Compare microscopes with an assistant

You can use ChatGPT, Claude, Copilot, or another assistant to explore {{ facility_short_name }} microscopes using the facility inventory below. Attach the inventory to the conversation so facility-specific claims stay grounded in what {{ facility_short_name }} records.

!!! note "Planning aid"
    Use the assistant to identify recorded options and questions to follow up. Staff can confirm sample compatibility, access, training, availability, and configuration details that are not captured in the inventory.

### 1. Download the facility inventory

